References
----------

HDAudio (kexts/HDAudio) is written for this project. Its controller and ring handling follow the
structure of FreeBSD's HD Audio driver (sys/dev/sound/pci/hda, BSD licence) and its IOAudio side
follows the layout of Apple's SamplePCIAudioDriver template (IOAudioFamily); register offsets and
encodings come from Intel's High Definition Audio Specification 1.0a.

The Mac OS X 10.5 SDK and Xcode 3.1 (Apple's licences) are needed to build and are not part of
this repository.

